    "updated_at": "2016-12-09T16:04:42Z",
    "body": "I filed this because we see a flicker of the animating logo in Safari and Firefox in https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=165644 when scrolling, but not Chrome. We suspected that Chrome wasn't following the clearing rules, but perhaps it's just the timing of the clear and subsequent drawing.",
